  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "On Steam, games only show up in your library if you paid for them or if they're installed. I find it mildly annoying that VRChat doesn't show up in my library when it's not installed.\n\nYou could perhaps do what many developers do and add a \"VRChat Soundtrack\" DLC, which you could charge some low amount (like $0.99) for, and I could pay for that to have VRChat stay in my library even when not installed. This could literally just be the one song you have: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2V21iQfG1PA",
